    DUPREY "匕首陨落行动是我们最后的豪赌。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:462
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_a90a9028:

    # DUPREY "We had managed some years before, before, when the war with the Demorai first really started, to suspend previous conflicts and form a loose alliance with the other kingdoms and races;"
    DUPREY "早些年德莫莱战争刚爆发时，我们曾成功搁置旧怨，与其他王国和种族结成松散联盟；"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:464
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_005134d0:

    # DUPREY "Didn’t do much good though when the bastards kept showing up everywhere."
