    BORRAS "发现生还者！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:822
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1688f5fb:

    # "He jumped down from his horse and quickly made his way over to the woman."
    "他跃下马背冲向那女子。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:828
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c561bdb5:

    # MARKUS "Captain, wait! Shouldn’t one of one of—"
    MARKUS "上尉等等！不该先派——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:829
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_de947a00:

    # "Before 马库斯 could even finish his sentence, Borras was crouched down in front of the woman, eye to eye with her like she was the only thing in the world."
    "马库斯话音未落，博拉斯已蹲跪女子面前，凝望她如世间唯一存在。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:830
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e2660bfe:

