    "回望见上尉策马狂奔而来，马蹄掀起漫天尘石。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:833
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_44efba98:

    # DUPREY "GET AWAY FROM HER, YOU FOOLS!"
    DUPREY "远离她，蠢货！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:834
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ef16b6ce:

    # "As Borras rested his hands on the woman’s shoulders, it was already too late."
    "当博拉斯的手触到她肩头时，为时已晚。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:842
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b08547c7:

    # "She stopped crying and the ground began to shake violently..."
    "哭泣骤停，大地猛烈震颤..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:845
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e64ba56e:

    # "Her lifeless eyes rolled white as a huge, monstrous... thing dragged itself from inside of her."
    "她死寂的眼珠翻白，巨大可怖的...怪物正从她体内钻出。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:846
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4b513b50:

    # "Scorpion like in appearance, with tentacles piercing its way through her orifices, it made the {i}dead{/i} woman scream."
    "蝎形身躯带着触手穿破她孔窍，竟让{i}已死{/i}的女子发出尖叫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:848
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_556e580b:

    # "The beast was a colossus, tearing down what remained of the house it had hidden under it rose onto its six legs."
    "巨兽撑塌藏身的残屋，六足立起宛如山峦。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:849
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4ab5169:

    # "It’s skin black and red, its eyes were glowing with malevolence, as it slavered in anticipation."
    "黑红相间的表皮，双眼闪烁恶意，垂涎欲滴。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:851
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_df99a23e:

