    KIARA "快躲开！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:852
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_d2a55f19:

    # "Horrified, Borras froze in fear before he moved to grab his sword, but it was too late."
    "博拉斯惊骇僵立，待要拔剑已迟。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:857
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d262ef:

    # "A toxic acid spewed from the thing’s mouth, Borras tried to roll to dodge the blast but was quickly engulfed and left writhing in agony, animal like cries shuddering through him."
    "怪物喷出毒酸，博拉斯翻滚闪避却被吞没，在剧痛中翻滚哀嚎如野兽。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:858
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_2d77f11e:

    # "Desperately, he clawed at his own melting face before becoming deathly quiet, limply turning to face us one with only the sizzling sounds of the acid still dissolving through his bones."
    "他徒劳抓挠熔化的脸，最终死寂瘫软转向我们，唯余酸液蚀骨的滋滋声。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:860
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f15fdca9:

    # "His eyes blinked in disbelief that he was about to die, with a trembling hand he tried to motion something with his sword."
    "他难以置信地眨眼，颤抖的手试图用剑比划什么。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:861
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_716bc802:

    # "There was nothing but horror etched onto what was left of his face before he collapsed, raising the sword up as if he was going to plunge it into himself."
    "残存的脸上唯刻恐惧，倒下前他高举剑柄，似要自我了断。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:862
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ad1aafe6:

    # "Instead, he planted it in the ground allowing it to take the weight of what we witnessed become his corpse, perhaps in a position he deemed more dignified than lying at the feet of the Demorai that killed him."
    "最终剑插大地支撑住残躯，这姿态或许比他心中所惧——倒毙于德莫莱足下——更显尊严。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:871
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acc7c430:

    # DUPREY "ON ME!"
    DUPREY "随我冲锋！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:885
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1b3652e9:

    # "Exhausted and at our breaking point, we watched as the thing slumped over to its side, bloodied and taking staggered breaths."
    "精疲力竭之际，我们看着那怪物血淋淋地瘫倒，呼吸断续。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:886
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a13bee82:

    # "Captain Duprey stormed towards it as it squirmed in agony, trying to drag itself away."
    "杜普雷上尉冲向痛苦挣扎欲逃的怪物。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:887
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_87fa56d5:

    # "Swinging his axe down one last time onto the thing’s head, in one clean cut Duprey eviscerated its skull and pierced through to its brain."
    "战斧最后一次劈落，干净利落剖开怪物的颅骨直贯脑髓。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:891
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3fc9c07e:

    # "We all looked around in horror as we waited for what was to happen next, slowly the Captain turned to look at us with lifeless eyes."
    "我们惊惶四顾等待后续，上尉缓缓转身，眼神死寂。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:894
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7f8a03ed:

    # MARKUS "... C-Captain... It... It just...."
    MARKUS "...上-上尉...它...它刚刚...."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:895
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8098a9e5:

    # DUPREY "... We’re nearly there. Come on...."
    DUPREY "... 我们快到了。跟上...."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:896
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8098a9e5:

    # DUPREY "... We’re nearly there. Come on...."
    DUPREY "... 我们快到了。跟上...."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:896
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_118a43a1:

    # MARKUS "But we—"
    MARKUS "可是我们——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:897
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4e07c4e9:

    # DUPREY "{i}Come. On.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}跟。上。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:898
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fdb0e643:

    # "As 马库斯 stared at Borras’ corpse, frozen in horror, the Captain put his hand almost tenderly on his shoulder."
    "当马库斯惊恐地僵在原地，盯着博拉斯的尸体时，队长几乎温柔地将手搭在了他的肩上。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:899
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b72d9ec2:

    # DUPREY "We keep moving, you understand?"
    DUPREY "我们继续前进，明白吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:900
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_42029655:

    # "马库斯 nodded weakly."
    "马库斯虚弱地点了点头。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:902
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acfa9909:

    # "Staggering towards his horse, the Captain clambered onto it and began to trot on ahead."
    "队长踉跄地走向他的马，爬上去后开始小跑前进。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:905
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e8141954:

    # "The men, horrified at what they had just witnessed, once again fell into place behind him."
    "士兵们被刚才目睹的景象吓坏了，再次默默跟在他身后列队行进。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:906
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fd3fd31f:

    # "By now, any optimism we had felt since our first small battle on the ridge was really and truly gone."
    "此刻，自从山脊上那场小规模战斗后残存的任何乐观情绪，都已彻底消失殆尽。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:907
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f3c22127:

    # "We had all been brutally reminded that out here, we were not the hunters, but the {i}hunted{/i}."
    "我们都被残酷地提醒：在这里，我们并非猎人，而是{i}猎物{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:917
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c21cf7c5:

    # "More than a week passed since Borras’ death."
    "博拉斯死后已过去一周多。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:918
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7cd181f4:

    # "Days and days of travelling on mercilessly, Duprey pushing us harder and harder, fuelled by the death of his friend."
    "杜普雷因挚友之死而愈发严苛，日复一日无情地驱赶我们加速前进。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:919
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_48ad92c6:

    # "We found ourselves marching through the thick, seemingly endless forest, every snap of a twig set us on edge as we looked out for enemies that might be lurking."
    "我们在茂密无边的森林中穿行，每根树枝的断裂声都让我们神经紧绷，警惕着可能潜伏的敌人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:920
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d0ae3b:

    # "I’d never before felt so vulnerable whilst being surrounded by so many people."
    "被这么多人包围着，我却从未感到如此脆弱。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:921
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e2d2b968:

    # "I marvelled over how we’d proceeded so long on this journey, carelessly allowing ourselves the hope that we might just be alright."
    "我惊异于我们竟在这趟旅程中前行了这么久，还轻率地怀抱着一切安好的希望。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:922
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_af5902e0:

    # "Now I found my heart was always racing."
    "如今我的心跳总是急促不安。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:923
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ef9db5b9:

    # "I allowed the fear to wash over me every morning, I depended on it to keep me on edge."
    "我任由恐惧每日清晨将我淹没，依赖它让我保持警觉。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:924
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ed8f2bdd:

    # "Sleep was nightmare after nightmare, I made sure that whenever I did manage to steal a few hours of rest that my sword was always within arm’s reach."
    "睡眠被接连不断的噩梦占据，我确保每次勉强偷得几小时休息时，佩剑总在伸手可及之处。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:925
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_093c96fb:

    # "Finally, just as the rain began to hammer down onto the ground and dark grey clouds circled overhead, we arrived at the fort."
    "终于，当暴雨开始倾泻大地、灰暗云层盘旋头顶时，我们抵达了要塞。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:929
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_85b5b56a:

    # "As we trudged our way inside the mud-soaked fort through what was left of the gate, we looked around at the dismal lifelessness of the place."
    "我们拖着脚步穿过残破大门，踏入泥泞的要塞内部，环顾这片死气沉沉的凄凉之地。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:931
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_88fc8c4d:

    # "There was no sign of anyone and there hadn’t been for a while."
    "这里杳无人迹，显然已荒废多时。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:932
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_0aca1b04:

    # "Here and there were scattered the ruinous remains of the old buildings and overturned fruit carts."
    "四处散落着古老建筑的残骸和倾覆的果车。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:935
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c976be39:

    # "Perhaps most prominently, and propped up by the various wooden frames, was a colossal tunnel that had been dug into the mountain itself."
    "最显眼的或许是那些由木架支撑、凿入山体的巨大隧道。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:936
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_079427da:

    # "Inside it was pitch black, but it was clear from the burned-out torches at the entrance that whoever had inhabited this place had spent a considerable amount of time in these tunnels."
    "隧道内漆黑一片，但入口处燃尽的火把表明，曾居于此地的生灵在这些隧道中耗费了大量时间。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:937
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_6cf2b373:

    # "Captain Duprey looked around and then turned to us cautiously."
    "杜普雷队长谨慎地环顾四周，然后转向我们。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:943
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c7470f9d:

    # DUPREY "Right, on me, you lot."
    DUPREY "好了，都跟我来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:949
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_bd175ca6:

    # "With freshly lit torches, we followed Captain Duprey deeper into the tunnel."
    "我们手持新点燃的火把，跟随杜普雷队长深入隧道。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:950
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3217bf80:

    # "It seemed to drag on endlessly, meandering up and down, delving deeper and deeper into the mountain."
    "隧道仿佛永无止境，蜿蜒起伏，不断向山体深处延伸。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:951
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e1df4315:

    # "We finally reached a formidable stone wall blocking our way, inscribed with strange markings I was not familiar with."
    "我们最终抵达一堵刻有陌生符文的巨石墙，挡住了去路。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:952
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_94a75c24:

    # "As the Captain gently touched his hand on its cold wet surface, the inscribed markings began to glow an ominous red and he stepped back, more cautious than I’d ever seen him."
    "当队长的手轻触冰冷潮湿的石面时，符文骤然泛起不祥的红光。他后退一步，神情是我从未见过的警惕。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:955
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e411519c:

    # DUPREY "Hmm..."
    DUPREY "嗯..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:958
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e67c2c91:

    # "He looked back at the others and whistled."
    "他回头看向其他人，吹了声口哨。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:959
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f242c681:

    # DUPREY "Get one of those mages down here now!"
    DUPREY "立刻叫个法师下来！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:960
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1ef1e65a:

    # DUPREY "I’ll bet any one of you a keg of rum that what we’re looking for is behind here."
    DUPREY "我赌你们每人一桶朗姆酒，我们要找的东西就在这后面。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:964
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_edba64a4:

    # "As a couple of the mages rushed forward, they frantically began to inspect the inscription, running their hands over it and muttering to themselves."
    "几名法师冲上前，疯狂检查着符文，手指抚过刻痕，口中念念有词。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:968
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c8092128:

    # MAGE "This may take us some time to open, Captain."
    MAGE "队长，开启此门可能需要些时间。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:969
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4f83352:

    # DUPREY "Hurry as quick as you can, I don’t like being caught in this forsaken place."
    DUPREY "尽快，我可不想被困在这鬼地方。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:970
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3142b6d0:

    # DUPREY "MEN! TAKE POSITIONS ON THE FORT! SECURE THE AREA!"
    DUPREY "士兵们！在要塞布防！确保区域安全！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:974
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3f5bdf35:

    # "We leapt to attention at his order and made our way out once again into the fort."
    "我们闻令而动，迅速撤出隧道回到要塞。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:975
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_cc451534:

    # MC "(Wonder what’s behind that thing?)"
    MC "(那后面究竟藏着什么？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:978
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a8bb7d00:

    # "The men moved to take positions around the remnants of the fort."
    "士兵们在要塞废墟周围就位。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:979
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8aa761bc:

    # "Nervous, I went and asked for some supplies from the supply wagon."
    "我心神不宁地走向补给车领取物资。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:983
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_734778e3:

    # "There was an eerie silence as we waited and watched impatiently, each of us wondering what had happened here, most of us too scared to voice our ideas."
    "等待中弥漫着诡异的寂静，人人焦躁地张望，内心揣测此地发生过什么，却因恐惧而不敢宣之于口。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:984
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c03a767e:

    # "Painted on the face of every man and woman was the unease of the realisation that we were sitting ducks."
    "每张脸上都写满了不安——我们意识到自己如同待宰的羔羊。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:985
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_da552107:

    # "We could do nothing more than pray that the seal would open and we could collect whatever was behind it quickly and leave this haunted place in our memories."
    "我们只能祈祷封印开启，迅速取走其后之物，将这梦魇之地永远封存于记忆。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:986
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_5092d10a:

    # "Restless, I was pacing from one watch spot to another."
    "我焦躁不安地在各个哨点间踱步。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:995
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_ed8e8a66:

    # "马库斯, much like me, was nervously patrolling the fort grounds."
    "马库斯和我一样，正紧张地在要塞内巡逻。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:996
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_5d8f8894:

    # "He feigned an awkward smile as I approached but the tension on his face was obvious. "
    "当我走近时，他挤出一个尴尬的微笑，但脸上的紧张显而易见。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:997
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_f2d0c1fa:

    # MARKUS "Hey, everything alright?"
    MARKUS "嘿，还好吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:999
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_0aa9896e:

    # MC "... What do you think of this place?"
    MC "...你觉得这地方怎么样？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1000
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_b23ea5da:

    # MARKUS "I think it’s a lot of bad news..."
    MARKUS "我觉得很不妙..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1004
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_1ed3230d:

    # MC "Right, sorry."
    MC "好吧，抱歉。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1005
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_feea6f2c:

    # MARKUS " ... {i}His face...{/i}"
    MARKUS " ... {i}他的脸...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1006
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_8d1be0c0:

    # "马库斯 shook his head as if to push the thought away."
    "马库斯摇摇头，仿佛要驱散这个念头。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1007
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_6f7fc962:

    # MC "Yeah... Let's try to think about something else for now."
    MC "是啊... 暂时想点别的吧。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1008
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_9c247fba:

    # MARKUS"Right..."
    MARKUS "好吧..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1010
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_81bd89c8:

    # MARKUS"No, thankfully, and I hope it stays that way."
    MARKUS "谢天谢地还没有，希望一直如此。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1011
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_d4864fc0:

    # MARKUS"This place is... {i}cursed{/i}."
    MARKUS "这地方... 被{i}诅咒了{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1012
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_b92104f7:

    # MC"... I might just be inclined to agree with you there."
    MC "... 我可能得同意你的看法。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1013
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_4f5cb3bc:

