    # DUPREY "Good work, let’s—"
    DUPREY "干得好，我们——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1179
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_39219a92:

    # "Suddenly, there was a loud scream from one of the men peering over the wooden wall."
    "突然，从木墙边窥探的一名士兵发出凄厉尖叫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1181
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_27abcf5a:

    # "A razor like tentacle swiped through, severing him in half."
    "剃刀般的触须横扫而过，将他拦腰斩断。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1187
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_890dd7ab:

    # "The fort erupted into {i}chaos.{/i}"
    "要塞瞬间陷入{i}混乱{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1189
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b08f1b16:

    # "People were screaming, panicking, unable to see where or what was coming for us."
    "人们尖叫着，陷入恐慌，既看不见袭击者的方位，也辨不清它们的真容。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1190
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2993b5b0:

    # "Above the terrified din, one man could be heard above the others, \"DEMORAI! DEMORAI ON THE WALLS!\"."
    "在惊恐的喧嚣中，一个声音压过众人：“恶魔种！墙上有恶魔种！”"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1194
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b39b5964:

    # "The first we saw of them was their claws on the upper fence line as they heaved the rest of their bodies over the walls."
    "我们最先看见的是它们攀上栅栏顶端的利爪，接着整个身躯翻越了围墙。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1195
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_dd1c2aa3:

    # "Hundreds of Demorai, all of them maniacally drooling as they swarmed us, euphoric at the prospect of devouring everyone below."
    "成百上千的恶魔种疯狂流着涎水蜂拥而至，为吞噬下方所有人的前景而狂喜。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1196
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_3ef0acdc:

    # "We drew our blades and a feverish battle ensued."
    "我们拔剑出鞘，激烈的战斗随即爆发。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1200
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5f1a2dc5:

    # DUPREY "HOLD THE WALLS! STOP THEM FLOODING IN!"
    DUPREY "守住围墙！阻止它们涌入！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1201
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b9441264:

    # DUPREY "FORM A SHIELD WALL BY THE GATE! QUICKLY!"
    DUPREY "在闸门组成盾墙！快！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1204
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_85235f90:

    # "As the men clambered around the gate, shields ready as they tried their best to fend off the ensuing horde, the Captain wildly swung his axe at the endless strays that managed to overpower the wall guards and clamber over."
    "士兵们在闸门周围集结，举盾竭力抵挡涌来的怪物。队长则挥舞战斧，砍向那些突破墙卫翻越而入的漏网之鱼。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1205
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9b292c68:

    # "Turning on my heel I saw 马库斯 and 琪亚拉 rush over to me, blades drawn as a small horde approached us, tongues lashing out of their mouths, ready to feast."
    "我转身看见马库斯和基娅拉持剑向我冲来，此时一小股怪物正逼近我们，长舌甩动，准备大快朵颐。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1214
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_db2481cf:

    # MC "{i}*Huff* *Huff*{/i} Come on! We need to help the Captain!"
    MC "{i}*喘气* *喘气*{/i} 快！得去帮队长！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1217
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d44596a1:

    # MARKUS "They’re everywhere!"
    MARKUS "它们到处都是！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1218
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_531db3fe:

    # KIARA "Look! They’re tearing down the bloody walls!"
    KIARA "看！它们在拆他妈的墙！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1219
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_38e33387:

    # "Looking over to the wall, blood and mud now soaking my face, I watched as the wood began to tremble and buckle under the weight of the swathes of Demorai clambering over it."
    "我望向围墙，血污与泥泞浸透脸颊，目睹木墙在攀爬的恶魔种重压下震颤变形。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1220
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_42997bec:

    # "In a tidal wave of teeth and claws, one side of the wall splintered and collapsed, dragging down with it all the Scouts fighting on it."
    "伴随着利齿与尖爪的浪潮，一段墙体轰然碎裂坍塌，将激战的斥候们一同埋葬。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1221
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8d131e57:

    # "Those that survived the collapse were immediately annihilated by the Demorai they found themselves encompassed by down below."
    "幸存者坠入下方，瞬间被包围的恶魔种撕成碎片。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1222
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_a4320b34:

    # MC "Fuck FUCK! Get back! GET BACK!"
    MC "操！操！后退！快后退！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1223
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8120254a:

    # "As we withdrew towards the entrance of the cave, unable to flee in any direction, some of the archers fumblingly fired off their lit arrows at the Demorai, engulfing them in flames."
    "我们退向洞穴入口，无处可逃。弓箭手慌乱射出火箭，将恶魔种卷入烈焰。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1227
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_1ecd081c:

    # DUPREY "COME AT ME BEASTIES! I’LL HAVE THE LOT OF YA!"
    DUPREY "来啊畜生们！老子把你们全收拾了！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1228
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0a8abb3e:

    # "With a hard push, we desperately tried to force our way forward to help the Captain who had been encircled, but more of the Demorai vaulted towards us."
    "我们奋力前冲试图解救被围的队长，更多恶魔种却朝我们扑来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1240
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_81e4429f:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Huff* *Huff*{/i} They just... {i}*Huff*{/i} Keep coming!"
    MARKUS "{i}*喘气* *喘气*{/i} 它们...{i}*喘气*{/i}源源不断！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1241
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f77ba669:

    # MC "Come on! We’re almost there! The Captain is—"
    MC "坚持！快到了！队长他——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1245
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c36b3b40:

    # "There was a deafening roar that caused the ground itself to shudder, piercing through our very souls."
    "震耳欲聋的咆哮令大地颤抖，直刺穿我们的灵魂。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1246
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_da95269f:

    # "As we all watched on ahead in horror, the men who had clustered around the gate with their shields and swords were flung aside in one mighty thrust."
    "我们惊恐地看见，聚在闸门举盾持剑的士兵被一股巨力掀飞。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1247
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_60a1befa:

    # "Dragging itself forward appeared a terrifying monstrosity unlike anything we had ever seen before."
    "一个前所未见的恐怖怪物拖行现身。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1248
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_546fcc0b:

    # "Almost humanoid in its shape, it stood up on its two thick hind legs."
    "它近乎人形，以粗壮后肢直立。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1249
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_49485a0a:

    # "It’s feet and hands seemed more talon than anything else and its teeth were too large for a mouth which struggled to contain them."
    "手足形似利爪，巨齿撑裂嘴角。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1250
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_911f3faa:

    # "Its wings blocked out what little light there was, forcing us to battle in the darkness it created."
    "双翼遮蔽微光，迫使我们在它制造的黑暗中战斗。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1251
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ae877858:

    # "With horns on its head, and a tail thrashing behind it, the thing was so much more than a nightmare."
    "头生犄角，尾如钢鞭，这存在远非噩梦所能形容。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1252
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_99643b26:

    # "Its flesh seemed coated in a thick bone-like armour."
    "躯体覆盖着骨状厚甲。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1253
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_cf3de208:

    # "One Scout who tried to swing his sword in an effort to pierce the creature, quickly found his blade bouncing off before the monster crushed him with his hand into nothing more than a pile of blood and bones and sinew."
    "一名斥候挥剑刺击，剑刃弹开瞬间，怪物的巨掌已将他碾作血肉骨渣。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1256
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_eac06cb0:

    # DUPREY "You... {i}It’s you.{/i}"
    DUPREY "是你...{i}果然是你{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1258
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f09f5f97:

    # "In its hands, the monstrous being held a huge double ended spear of thick metal that pulsated dark energy."
    "怪物手中握着一柄巨大的双头金属矛，黑暗能量在其上脉动。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1259
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_25ac5a3d:

    # "It seemed as large as the trunk of a tree, towering five times over any man."
    "矛身粗如树干，高度五倍于人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1260
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c9542159:

    # "{i}... And it was heading right for us...{/i}"
    "{i}...而它正朝我们冲来...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1261
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5189fafd:

    # "The Captain, bloodied and weary, looked towards us as he saw the thing heading our way."
    "浴血疲惫的队长见怪物冲向我们，朝我们望来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1262
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0cc043e0:

    # "Duprey loudly cried out to grab its attention."
    "杜普雷高声呼喊吸引它的注意。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1264
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_1faa759c:

    # DUPREY "ZANARAK!"
    DUPREY "扎纳拉克！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1265
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7805a38d:

    # "Hearing that name sent a shiver down my spine, I felt myself becoming increasingly delirious from all the fighting and bloodshed around me."
    "那名字令我脊背发凉。周围的厮杀与血腥让我神志渐失。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.r:1266
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_a006cbcf:

    # "It became hard to focus on the enormity of what was happening as that name sunk deep into the core of me, filling me with an icy terror."
    "当那名字深入骨髓，冰冷的恐惧淹没了我，再难聚焦于眼前的浩劫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1267
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_625b466c:

    # "I felt that I might collapse at any moment as blackness crept into my vision."
    "黑暗侵蚀视野，我感到随时会倒下。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1268
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_422d9dcd:

    # "I started to pray for it, thinking it would be a small mercy to give myself over to the darkness and escape the decimation around me."
    "我开始祈求黑暗降临，将意识交予虚无以逃离周遭的毁灭，也算一种慈悲。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1269
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aef12e9d:

    # "But the adrenaline snapped me awake and forced me to watch as the two squared off."
    "但肾上腺素让我猛然清醒，被迫目睹二者对峙。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1270
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_30c39a8f:

    # "The thing glared at him, hatred spewing from its eyes as it became clear the monstrous bogeyman of our childhood {i}recognised him.{/i}"
    "怪物怒视着他，眼中喷薄着恨意——显然我们童年的梦魇{i}认出了他{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1271
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5b38abb9:

    # DUPREY "{i}After all these years...{/i} Again we face each other!"
    DUPREY "{i}这么多年后...{/i} 我们再次对决！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1273
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9f3b7d0e:

    # DUPREY "Aye, beasty! So, you DO recognise me!"
    DUPREY "哈，畜生！看来你确实认得我！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1274
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e5950610:

    # DUPREY " I knew there was a brain behind that thick fucking skull of yours!"
    DUPREY " 我就知道你他妈厚脑壳里还有点脑子！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1276
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ddeb9dfe:

    # DUPREY "Come on then, you fuck! LET’S SEE YOU TRY TO FUCKING KILL ME!"
    DUPREY "来啊杂种！让老子看看你怎么杀我！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1277
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_1c9a8a91:

    # DUPREY "For Newheart! FOR ALDERAYYYYY!"
    DUPREY "为了新心镇！为了奥尔德雷——！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1278
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_309bf98b:

    # "Lunging forward, the Captain flung himself screaming at the beast, dodging one of Zanarak’s swipes as he brought his mighty axe down on him, slashing at the beast’s ribs with all his strength."
    "队长咆哮着扑向巨兽，躲过扎纳拉克的挥击，战斧全力劈向其肋骨。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1279
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c5ac5daf:

    # "Zanarak staggered, the blade had bounced off his flesh and failed to cut him, but it must have hurt."
    "扎纳拉克踉跄一步。斧刃虽被皮甲弹开未能斩入，但显然造成了痛楚。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1280
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2f8ae10d:

    # "The Captain once again moved to dodge Zanarak’s swishing tail as it smashed into one of the walls, flinging everything still climbing them to the mud and blood beneath."
    "队长再次闪避横扫的尾鞭，长尾击碎一段墙体，将攀附其上的所有事物甩入下方血泥。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1281
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ef64d10d:

    # "Once again lunging forward, Captain Duprey rolled forward to evade the sweeping swing of Zanarak’s spear and leapt up to attack, smashing Zanarak’s face with his axe, causing him to drop the spear."
    "杜普雷队长再次前冲，翻滚躲过矛刃横扫，跃起劈中扎纳拉克面部，令其长矛脱手。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1282
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_be32a2be:

    # KIARA "Why doesn’t his axe pierce its flesh?!"
    KIARA "为什么他的斧头砍不穿那怪物的皮？！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1283
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b1e2cdd8:

    # MC "I don’t know! It’s hide must be too thick!"
    MC "不知道！它的皮肯定太厚了！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1284
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8d41be99:

    # "While it staggered, the Captain once again continued a fury of heavy hits, causing Zanarak to fumble backwards, blood dripping down his face from where the axe had managed to pierce through his hard skin."
    "怪物踉跄时，队长发动暴风骤雨般的猛击。扎纳拉克狼狈后退，斧刃终于破开硬皮之处鲜血淋漓。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1285
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_906e6a5f:

    # "For a moment, it felt like victory was at hand, that the Captain would overcome Zanarak and save the day."
    "刹那间胜利仿佛触手可及，队长即将击败扎纳拉克力挽狂澜。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1286
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_16ea6760:

    # DUPREY "Come on! Is that all you’ve—"
    DUPREY "就这点本事？你只——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1287
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d0d64118:

    # "Suddenly, Zanarak charged forward with such speed with such speed, he caught the Captain off guard. With one backhand of his claw, he sent the Captain tumbling into the mud."
    "扎纳拉克骤然加速突袭，队长猝不及防。利爪反手一击将他砸入泥泞。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1288
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_721e4ea2:

    # "Coughing and retching up blood, he moved to grab his axe once again but before he could, Zanarak was on him, knocking the axe away with his foot as he grabbed Captain Duprey with both hands."
    "他咳着血试图抓回战斧，扎纳拉克却已逼近，一脚踢飞斧头，双爪攫住他。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1289
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e7a8fc89:

    # "Frantically, we continued to fight our way forward through the hordes of Demorai, but were powerless to save him, we could only watch... {i}and despair.{/i}"
    "我们拼命杀穿恶魔种群试图救援，却无能为力，只能眼睁睁看着...{i}陷入绝望{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1291
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aab6a330:

    # "Zanarak’s tongue licked its lips in anticipation as a cruel smile crawled across its face. It brought the Captain closer, quivering with excitement."
    "扎纳拉克舔舐嘴唇，狞笑浮现，兴奋得颤抖着将队长拉近。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1292
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b28e6f0b:

    # DUPREY "{i}Fucking... choke on me...{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}噎死...你这杂种...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1293
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b41bcfd6:

    # DUPREY "{i}YOU CUNT!{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}操你妈！{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1294
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7d68f31c:

    # "In one last effort of defiance, the Captain swung his head forward to smash his forehead against Zanarak, causing his own head to bleed in the process as he spat his blood onto Zanarak’s darkly bemused face."
    "队长最后猛撞额头反击，自己头破血流，将血唾喷在扎纳拉克阴鸷的脸上。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1297
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_47940fd0:

    # "Zanarak, in return, snarled angrily as he crushed the Captain in his powerful taloned hands."
    "扎纳拉克暴怒低吼，利爪碾碎了队长。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1299
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_69683e08:

    # "Duprey’s agonising scream almost seemed to satiate him before he plunged his jaw forward and greedily tore him apart in a bloody, violent mess."
    "杜普雷的惨嚎似令它餍足，随后它探出巨颚，贪婪地将队长撕成血腥碎块。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1304
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_64f442b9:

    # "Distantly, I felt 马库斯’ hand on my shoulder pull me back as the world around me became quiet as a graveyard."
    "恍惚间，马库斯的手将我拽回。周遭死寂如坟场。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1305
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9a29d94f:

    # "When he spoke, I couldn’t quite hear what he was saying until he shook me violently and sound all seemed to rush back at once."
    "他的话语模糊不清，直到他猛摇我肩膀，声音才骤然灌入耳中。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1316
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4bbe56ad:

    # "Shaking my head fearfully, I turned towards 琪亚拉."
    "我惊惧摇头，转向基娅拉。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1318
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e7d23a00:

    # MC "We have to go!"
    MC "快走！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1319
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2ead6772:

    # "As 琪亚拉 battled off some of the Demorai and turned to face me, she suddenly stopped in her tracks with a shudder."
    "基娅拉击退几只恶魔种转身时，突然战栗着僵在原地。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1327
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5c962eab:

    # "Peering down in an almost comical confusion she noticed what we all saw happen; a tentacle had thrust its way through 琪亚拉的 chest."
    "她困惑地低头，滑稽地发现我们都目睹的景象：一根触须贯穿了她的胸膛。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1328
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8942250d:

    # "I looked at her, and she me, paralysed with terror."
    "我看着她，她看着我，恐惧令我们动弹不得。"
# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1329
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_6e5b7aa8:

    # "With a trail of blood seeping from the side of her mouth, she simply said..."
    "鲜血从她嘴角渗出，她只吐出两个字..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1330
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_af03a4be:

    # KIARA "{i}Run...{/i}"
    KIARA "{i}跑...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1331
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4de9edf4:

    # "And with that 琪亚拉 was flung backwards into the throes of battle."
    "话音未落，她已被甩回混战中心。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1333
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b1bef907:

    # "Feeling a surge of manic grief, I screamed as I tried to fling myself forward to save her, but 马库斯 used all his strength and held me back."
    "狂乱的悲痛席卷而来，我尖叫着前冲想救她，马库斯用尽全力拽住了我。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1334
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_61978aa7:

    # MARKUS "IT’S TOO LATE, SHE’S GONE!"
    MARKUS "太迟了！她没了！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1335
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f4e00510:

    # "Determinedly pulling me back, 马库斯 cried..."
    "马库斯决然将我拖回，嘶喊着..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1336
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0da52be2:

    # MARKUS "The battle is lost! We have to retreat!"
    MARKUS "战斗输了！必须撤退！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1337
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_cf98d2a8:

    # MC "We’re surrounded!"
    MC "我们被包围了！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1338
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8baa2c55:

    # "马库斯 looked around wildly, staring back at the entrance to the cavern and pulled me along."
    "马库斯狂乱四顾，目光锁定洞穴入口，拽着我前行。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1339
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_363568e5:

    # MARKUS "Come on! It’s the only way!"
    MARKUS "快！这是唯一的路！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1345
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4170c645:

    # MC "HURRY!"
    MC "快！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1346
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7ad62c8c:

    # MARKUS "It won’t close!"
    MARKUS "关不上！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1347
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d7589ccf:

    # MC "CLOSE IT! CLOSE THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "关上！把他妈的门关上！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1348
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ef27cd89:

    # MARKUS "I’m trying!"
    MARKUS "我在试！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1349
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2cd10d35:

    # MC "MARKUS! HURRY! IT’S NEARLY—"
    MC "马库斯！快！它快——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1359
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f00dab72:

    # "Exhausted, caked in dirt and grime, me and 马库斯 looked at each other wearily."
    "精疲力竭，满身血污泥垢，我和马库斯疲惫对视。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1360
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_60add535:

    # "The sounds of fighting outside had slowly died down, only an eerie silence was left."
    "外面的厮杀声渐息，只剩诡异的死寂。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1361
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_fe368176:

    # "We found ourselves speaking in whispers."
    "我们不自觉地用气声交谈。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1362
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c55369df:

    # MARKUS "Are we...?"
    MARKUS "难道我们...？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1363
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aa0d9848:

    # MC "{i}We’re the only ones left.{/i}"
    MC "{i}只剩我们了{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1364
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_69308a51:

    # "The dawning realisation caused the blood to run cold in our veins, slowly we turned to look around at what may be our tomb."
    "这认知让血液冻结，我们缓缓环顾这可能的坟墓。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1365
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_adf58131:

    # "The chamber was unusual."
    "这间石室不同寻常。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1366
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_a845dd1f:

    # "Two strange obelisks stood menacingly in the center of the room."
    "两根奇异的方尖碑矗立室中，散发不祥气息。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1371
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7f07395e:

    # "One of the perfect pair black, the other white, they looked timeless, ancient."
    "一黑一白完美相对，透着亘古的沧桑。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1372
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_3e4b9aee:

    # MC "What are those?..."
    MC "那些是什么？..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1374
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d6fd9fd7:

    # "Reluctantly shifting my gaze to examine the room, I saw tables full of vials and half empty potions."
    "我移开视线环顾，看见堆满小瓶和半空药剂的桌子。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1375
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_380c3d56:

    # "Various pieces of paper were scattered around the floor — someone had left in a hurry."
    "纸张散落一地——有人匆忙离去。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1376
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_180b3c82:

    # MARKUS "What is this place?"
    MARKUS "这是什么地方？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1377
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0b01172f:

    # MC "I can’t even guess..."
    MC "完全猜不出..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1378
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7f34c1ab:

    # MC "There has to be a way out of here though so, let’s see if we can find some kind of secret exit or something..."
    MC "但肯定有出路...找找看有没有暗门之类的..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1380
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5e963aa5:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Well, it sure beats waiting around to die..."
    MARKUS "{i}*叹气*{/i} 总比坐等送死强..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1390
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_1490ecb4:

    # "Picking up some of the papers, I tried to piece them together and decipher some of what was going on."
    "我拾起纸张尝试拼凑，试图解读发生了什么。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1391
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_a36fbb89:

    # "{i}‘Subjects remain in petrified state until we can discover a means to try quelling their ‘parasitic’ natures.{/i}"
    "{i}‘实验体保持石化状态，直至找到抑制其‘寄生’本性的方法。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1392
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_3778fff4:

    # "{i}Neither Kern, Luxma, Burning Wings or Scun seem to have any chemical impact on ‘controlling’ them.’{/i}"
    "{i}克恩草、光苔、燃翼花或斯卡恩藤均未显现‘控制’效果。’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1393
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_b2aa7c93:

    # "Hastily scribbled on the bottom was..."
    "页脚潦草写着..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1394
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_68192352:

    # "{i}‘All other current botanic ingredients local to Alderay have proven ineffective, requesting more ‘exotic’ ingredients to test with from neighbouring kingdoms.’{/i}"
    "{i}‘奥尔德雷本地所有植物成分均无效，请求从邻国获取更多‘异域’材料进行测试。’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1395
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_3ead958e:

    # "{i}‘Just what will it take to get these things under control?’{/i}"
    "{i}‘究竟要怎样才能控制这些东西？’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1396
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_ea56ab57:

    # MC "(What are they talking about?)"
    MC "(他们在说什么？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1404
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_fe8092c0:

    # "Slumped down dead against the wall, still in his dark dusty robes, was the body of a Dark Mage clutching at some letter in his hands."
    "一具黑袍覆尘的暗法师尸体倚墙而亡，手中紧攥信件。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1405
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_737d8344:

    # MARKUS "What’s a Dark Mage doing here?"
    MARKUS "暗法师怎么会在这儿？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1406
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_ecae0ae1:

    # MC "I don’t know..."
    MC "不知道..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1407
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_8143ea13:

    # "Reaching down, I pulled the crumpled letter from the skeleton hands of the Dark Mage."
    "我俯身从骸骨手中抽出皱缩的信。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1408
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_1c0d9374:

    # "As I did so, some the skeleton's bones disintegrated into ash right before my eyes."
    "触碰瞬间，部分骸骨在我眼前化为灰烬。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1409
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_aeb74839:

    #"‘Consider this my final gift unto you, {i}my lord{/i}, I die safe in the knowledge that once you retrieve these things, you will finally turn the tide of this war...’"
    "‘谨以此为我最后的献礼，{i}吾主{/i}。我死而无憾，因您取回此物之日，便是扭转战局之时...’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1410
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_56e8ecef:

    #"‘But be wary, their power is still highly unstable... Choose only the finest to wield them, for to choose any less would spell {i}disaster{/i} for the realm.’"
    "‘然其力仍极凶险...务必择最强者持之，凡庸之辈若得，恐为王国{i}浩劫{/i}。’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1411
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_b633e548:

    #"‘Yours faithfully, forever, Kharlof.’"
    "‘您忠实的仆从，卡洛夫。’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1412
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_a28c417d:

    # MC"(My lord? Turning the tide of the war? What is he talking about?)"
    MC "(吾主？扭转战局？他在说什么？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1420
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_82c068b8:

    #"Inspecting the dust covered tables of potions, I tried reading the dozens of labels on each of the various jars and vials but recognized almost none of the ingredients."
    "我检查着布满灰尘的药剂桌，试图辨认各种瓶罐上的标签，却几乎认不出任何成分。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1421
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_03c042eb:

    # MC"What is all this for?"
    MC "这些都是做什么用的？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1423
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_27c7f643:

    #"马库斯 glanced over the potions and picked one up:"
    "马库斯扫视着药剂，拿起一瓶："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1424
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_9c69b8c3:

    # MARKUS"They were certainly working hard to solve... {i}something{/i}."
    MARKUS "他们显然在努力解决... {i}某个问题{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1431
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8c77d8f3:

    #"Apprehensively, the two of us finally made our way over to the obelisks."
    "我们两人惴惴不安地走向方尖碑。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1432
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c0f14f6:

    #"As I listened closely, I could almost hear a... {i}a heartbeat?{/i}"
    "当我凝神细听，几乎能听到... {i}心跳声？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1433
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6256818a:

    # MARKUS"What are these things?"
    MARKUS "这些是什么东西？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1434
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cac275a:

    #"Feeling a gnawing urge to reach out and touch the monument, I rested my hand on its ice-cold surface."
    "一股强烈的冲动驱使着我伸手触摸纪念碑，我将手放在它冰冷的表面上。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1436
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f151046e:

    #"I’ve noticed 马库斯 doing the same..."
    "我注意到马库斯也在做同样的事..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1437
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a1e080a:

    #"This alone frightened me, and with a shudder I withdrew my hand just as fast."
    "这让我感到恐惧，我猛地抽回手，浑身发抖。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1438
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c246b715:

    #"马库斯 looked at me, pulling his hand back as well."
    "马库斯看着我，也收回了手。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1439
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_864bdbb5:

    # MARKUS"You okay?"
    MARKUS "你还好吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1440
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_81175200:

    # MC"This is weird, I thought—"
    MC "这太诡异了，我以为——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1444
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8505186f:

    #"Suddenly, both monuments began to illuminate with colorful markings..."
    "突然，两座纪念碑都亮起了彩色的符文..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1445
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_63884bfb:

    #"We stepped back fearfully, holding out our swords and mustering the remainders of our strength, naively hoping to protect ourselves from whatever dark magic these stones were channeling."
