    "那声音清晰得不像是我的思绪，然而..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1556
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1dd8dbb8:

    # BLACK_VOICE"{i}No.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}没有{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1557
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7849ce3f:

    # MC"... No, sir."
    MC "...没有，大人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1558
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_55fad953:

    #"I noticed that 马库斯 had realised I was lying — he quickly looked to hide his expression."
    "我注意到马库斯察觉我在说谎——他迅速移开视线掩饰表情。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1559
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_eee1e18d:

    #"The Emperor raised a curious eyebrow."
    "皇帝好奇地挑起眉毛。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1560
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cb6cfe3e:

    # ALCOTT"{i}'No'?{/i}"
    ALCOTT "{i}‘没有’？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1561
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_acc6fa77:

    # MC"Everything inside was destroyed, the Demorai must have reached it long before we did."
    MC "里面的一切都被毁了，德莫莱肯定比我们早到很久。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1562
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7b122b05:

    #"My foggy mind didn't seem to bother lying straight to Alcott's face."
    "我昏沉的头脑似乎毫不在意对阿尔科特当面撒谎。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1563
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c69602a0_1:

    # ALCOTT"I see..."
    ALCOTT "我明白了..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1564
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5bc491e1:

    # MC"Everyone was killed, we barely made it out alive..."
    MC "所有人都死了很多人，我们勉强逃出来..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1565
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a02226be:

    #"To my own surprise it effortlessly weaved together a story, line after line, of our escape."
    "令我惊讶的是，它毫不费力地编造出我们逃亡的故事，一句接一句。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1566
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e14fa103:

    # ALCOTT"No survivors?"
    ALCOTT "没有幸存者？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1567
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d1f86cf3:

    # MC"We were the only ones."
    MC "只有我们两个。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1568
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d8270823:

    #"I felt as if {i}someone else{/i} took over."
    "我感觉像是{i}另一个人{/i}在控制我。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1569
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b9c27286:

    # ALCOTT"And how did you two escape exactly?"
    ALCOTT "你们具体是怎么逃出来的？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1570
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a556510:

    # MC"We managed to make a break for it after locking ourselves away in the tunnels, sir."
    MC "我们把自己锁在隧道里，然后找机会逃了出来，大人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1571
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5742e785:

    # MC"By nightfall they had left the fort, so we made our way back."
    MC "夜幕降临时他们离开了要塞，我们就往回走。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1572
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7d7776a6:

    #"Alcott crossed his arms on his chestplate as he slowly paced the next question:"
    "阿尔科特将双臂交叉在胸甲前，缓缓提出下一个问题："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1573
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e654f18:

    # ALCOTT"You expect me to believe that you two made a month-long journey through enemy lands..."
    ALCOTT "你们指望我相信，两人穿越敌境走了整整一个月的路程..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1574
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_44694190:

    # ALCOTT"On foot, alone, injured, starving..."
    ALCOTT "徒步、孤立无援、负伤、饥饿..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1575
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d485f664:

    # ALCOTT"...{b}In one week?{/b}"
    ALCOTT "...{b}只用了一周？{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1576
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c22aa46f:

    #"What?..."
    "什么？..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1577
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d7252fc7:

    # MC"A w— It's only been a week?!"
    MC "一——才过了一周？！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1578
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_92549c50:

    # "Through just the slightest lowering of his eyebrows Alcott betrayed his surprise of my reaction."
    "阿尔科特眉头微蹙，泄露了他对我反应的惊讶。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1579
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3303201a:

    # "Seconds later the emotionless mask was back in place."
    "几秒后，冷漠的面具重新戴上。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1580
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_23bd3c52:

    # ALCOTT "Now give me {i}the truth{/i}."
    ALCOTT "现在告诉我{i}真相{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1581
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_718626ed:

    # MC "I... That's all I can remember."
    MC "我...我只记得这些。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1582
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cba3c031:

    # ALCOTT"Believe me when I say that you do not want to lie to me."
    ALCOTT "相信我，你不会想对我撒谎。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1583
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b4c4b58d:

    # MC"My lord, it is the truth!"
    MC "陛下，这就是真相！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1584
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6bbafbe2:

    # MC"I can only remember so much of the journey back."
    MC "我只记得回程的部分片段。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1585
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_abbd9edb:

    # MC"The rest... If there was anything, it is {i}missing{/i}..."
    MC "其余部分...如果有的话，也{i}缺失了{/i}..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1586
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b9c59d79:

    #"Alcott looked over towards 马库斯."
    "阿尔科特看向马库斯。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1587
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a5405cc9:

    # ALCOTT"What about you?"
    ALCOTT "你呢？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1588
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f83b330e:

    # ALCOTT"Do you have anything to add?"
    ALCOTT "有什么要补充的吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1589
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_efa73dec:

    #"马库斯 shook his head grimly."
    "马库斯阴沉地摇了摇头。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1590
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c6a66cbe:

    # ALCOTT"How inconvenient."
    ALCOTT "真不方便。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1591
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f8657076:

    #"Alcott took a thoughtful pause, then, as if remembered something, asked:"
    "阿尔科特沉思片刻，随后像想起什么似的问道："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1592
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3f6b14d4:

    # ALCOTT"Why were you both naked when we recovered you?"
    ALCOTT "为什么找到你们时两人都赤身裸体？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1593
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_53ac8cdc:

    # MC"I... I don't know, sir."
    MC "我...我不知道，大人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1594
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_98755bac:

    # MC "Everything is daze, I'm sorry, my lord, it all feels like a nightmare..."
    MC "一切都模糊不清，很抱歉陛下，感觉就像一场噩梦..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1595
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_58b51746:

    # ALCOTT"Hmm. I see."
    ALCOTT "嗯，知道了。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1596
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a0073a56:

    # ALCOTT"You best hope your memories return swiftly, there are still many questions about what has happened to the Second Scouts."
    ALCOTT "你们最好祈祷记忆尽快恢复，关于第二侦察队发生了什么仍有许多疑问。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1597
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_41fa21ba:

    # ALCOTT"Questions {i}I{/i} want answers to."
    ALCOTT "{i}我{/i}需要答案。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1598
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b23d52c3:

    # MC"... I will do my best to remember, my lord."
    MC "...我会尽力回忆，陛下。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1599
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e91bd01:

    #"I was convinced that Alcott did not entirely believe my story, but it must have satisfied him enough for now at least."
    "我确信阿尔科特并未完全相信我的说辞，但至少暂时让他满意了。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1600
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_976a04cd:

    # ALCOTT"... In light of the unusual circumstances surrounding the Second Scouts Division and the danger you single-handedly faced along with the losses your unit suffered, you are both hereby relinquished of your duties as Scouts."
    ALCOTT "...鉴于第二侦察队的特殊情况、你们独自面对的危险以及部队遭受的损失，现解除你们二人的侦察兵职务。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1601
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1bf8606f:

    # MC"Sir? You mean—"
    MC "大人？您的意思是——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1602
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_fd2f53f3:

    # ALCOTT"HOWEVER, the two of you shall instead sign up to the Adventurer's Guild."
    ALCOTT "但是，你们二人需加入冒险者公会。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1603
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3b1d3c63:

    # MC "The... The {i}Adventurer's Guild?{/i}"
    MC "冒...{i}冒险者公会？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1604
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_85f508b4:

    # ALCOTT"You are free to live and stay in the Capital unless the city itself falls under siege, upon which you, like all other able bodied, are still bound to heed the call to arms."
    ALCOTT "你们可自由在首都生活居住，除非城市遭围困——届时你们仍需像所有健全者一样响应征召。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1605
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_99546b5d:

    # ALCOTT"Elsewise you shall serve the Empire as Guild members instead."
    ALCOTT "其余时间则以公会成员身份为帝国效力。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1606
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f0433fc8:

    # 奥尔科特"This is offered to you solely on the highly unusual circumstances surrounding your... survival."
    ALCOTT "给予此安排，完全基于你们...生还的极端特殊情况。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1607
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2e2bde2d:

    # 奥尔科特"You are now far more useful to me alive than dead."
    ALCOTT "你们活着比死了对我更有价值。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1608
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4b45d7d3:

    # 奥尔科特"Both of you are forbidden to speak about your mission and its failure to anyone, understand?"
    ALCOTT "你们两人都禁止向任何人谈论你们的任务及其失败，明白吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1609
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_623d4f96:

    #"Me and 马库斯 both nodded, giving our best 'yes, sirs'."
    "我和马库斯都点了点头，竭尽全力地回应‘遵命，长官’。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1611
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e69568ef:

    # 奥尔科特"In return for this you will both {i}also{/i} be required to help me with... {i}raising morale.{/i}"
    ALCOTT "作为回报，你们俩{i}还{/i}需要协助我...{i}提振士气{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1612
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e35cd6bf:

    #"Both me and 马库斯 just looked at each other, clueless."
    "我和马库斯困惑地对视了一眼。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1613
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4ef65ac0:

    # MC"... Sir?"
    MC "...长官？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1614
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1255a968:

    # 奥尔科特"As far as anyone is concerned, you two single-handedly and {i}bravely{/i} fought together, slaying dozens of Demorai and returned not as lone survivors, but as {i}heroes{/i}. Understand?"
    ALCOTT "在所有人眼中，你们俩{i}英勇{/i}并肩作战，亲手斩杀数十名德莫莱人。你们不是仅存的幸存者，而是凯旋的{i}英雄{/i}。明白吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1615
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5fbe41cb:

    # MC"But—"
    MC "但是——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1616
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c5ee3b38:

    # 奥尔科特"As of now, most of the city is talking about the two surviving heroes."
    ALCOTT "此刻，全城都在谈论两位幸存的英雄。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1617
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_bc98f3ed:

    # ALCOTT"I intend to salvage something out of this affair to help people keep the faith."
    ALCOTT "我打算从这场灾难中挽回些东西，帮人们重拾信念。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1618
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_48409954:

    # ALCOTT"They {b}will not{/b} hear of the massacre that you walked into, that story will die in this room and you two will only speak of the bravery and courage of your comrades."
    ALCOTT "他们{b}绝不可{/b}知晓你们遭遇的大屠杀。真相将在此终结，你们只能讲述战友的英勇事迹。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1619
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a5be7a25:

    #"The Emperor wants us..."
    "皇帝要我们..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1620
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_363258d4:

    #"{i}To lie?{/i}"
    "{i}撒谎？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1621
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e0c9d687:

    # ALCOTT"Given the fate you have managed to escape, visiting public places to wave and smile around is not such a bad alternative."
    ALCOTT "想想你们侥幸逃脱的命运，在公众场合挥手微笑倒也不算太糟。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1622
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_0650d1f5:

    # ALCOTT"Don't you agree?"
    ALCOTT "你们不这么认为吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1623
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_58572838:

    # MC "... Yes, sir."
    MC "...遵命，长官。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1624
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_49b19704:

    # MARKUS "Yes, my lord."
    MARKUS "遵命，陛下。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1625
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_635c96ff:

    # ALCOTT "Good. I will leave you to rest now."
    ALCOTT "很好。现在你们好好休息吧。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1626
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a378d60:

    # ALCOTT "Farewell."
    ALCOTT "告辞。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1628
translate zh qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2c3737af:

    # "The Emperor sauntered off with his guards."
    "皇帝在护卫簇拥下踱步离去。"

